-- SI7-BLIZZ 29726 SI:7 Report: Hostile Natives (Pearlfin Village): build The Debriefing 03 scene (the player is Little Lu at Widow Greenpaw's hut) on top of the open-world variant of 2026_11_02_97 (the sign, the two statues and their credits stay as they are and keep working outside the scene).
-- Retail flow (video https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QJkTY1Eo_-g, whisper transcript tr_lu.txt; 5.4.8 Spell.dbc "The Debriefing 03" spells): accept at Little Lu 55284 -> Teleport In (103563) -> Summon Yu Vehicle (103564, Little Lu 55371, ride spell 103570 Yu's Report) -> Summon Master 103569 summons Amber 55372 (103567) and Rell 55373 (103568) at the camp, Sully 55374 (103566, follows) and Socks 55611 (104114, follows) -> camp dialogue 54071/53897-53902 (Rell is worsening, "this is a pandaren hut, the pandaren are allies", Lu and Sully go, with Socks) -> the sign (54083/54086) -> the lawn full of jade statues (54084/54087), the petrified orc (54085/54088) -> after both statues are inspected the Widow emerges from the house (54115, 104119 Summon Widow 55381) -> dialogue 54089-54092, 54094, 54093 -> Widow laughs (54095) and turns Socks into jade (103475 Jadefication) -> Sully 54096 "SOCKS! NOOO" and 54127 "Run, Little Lu!" -> credit 55381 (objective "Speak with Widow Greenpaw") -> back at Pearlfin, Lu 55284 says 54129.
-- Objectives: sign GO 209615 (goober, KillCreditGO on use; use from a controlled vehicle is allowed, SpellHandler.cpp IsOnVehicle check), Lifelike Jade Statue 55378 and Suspicious Jade Statue 55380 (gossip credit from 2026_11_02_97; they now also report to the Lu vehicle), Widow 55381 (scene credit, CALL_KILLEDMONSTER because target 105 is not implemented here).
-- VehicleId 55371 = 1774: entry order 55335 (= 1773) < 55371 < 55403 (= 1776) leaves 1774/1775; 1774 (seat 10243, 0xe2100a06 CAN_CONTROL, the seat flags proven for Rell) fits a walking Lu, 1775 (three seats 0x21) does not.
-- Source: 5.4.8 Spell.dbc/SpellEffect.dbc/SummonProperties.dbc (103563/103564/103566-103569/103570/103575/103580/103752/103753/104114/104119/103475), Vehicle.dbc/VehicleSeat.dbc 18414, broadcast_text 54071, 53897-53902, 54083-54096, 54115, 54127, 54129, video QJkTY1Eo_-g + transcript (line order and timing), world DB spawns at the hut (Widow 55368 guid 501929 1498.5 -1301.8, statue 55378 guid 407627 1502.2 -1260.2, 55380 guid 5130151 1488.2 -1246.2, sign 209615 guid 548082 1464.9 -1341.7, cubs/bamboo around it for ground heights).
-- DERIVED (no sniff): all scene positions (camp 20 yd south-west of the sign, Widow's door in front of the hut, her walk target on the lawn), the speakers of 53897/53900 (Amber: she is the one who stays with the commander), the trigger moments (sign at 8 yd, lawn at 18 yd from 55378, orc statue at 10 yd from 55380), the timing between lines, Rell lying (stand state sleep), the Widow's unplaced lines of the video ("striking pose", "come a little closer", "they call me": not in broadcast_text, left out), Socks' "Squeak!" 54128 (moment unknown, left out), the teleport-back spot, failsafe 900 s.
-- (correction 5-11-2026 02:28, dev test 29725) event_flags 512 is NOT "while charmed" on this core: SmartScriptMgr.h has no such flag, 0x200 = SMART_EVENT_FLAG_DIFFICULTY_RAID40, so flagged rows never ran on map 870. The vehicle rows below now use flags 0/1; SmartScript::ProcessEvent has no charm check, vehicle events fire while the player drives.
